[
  {
    "beat_id": 1,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen picks up the coffee cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "顾深站在咖啡店门口，手里拿着一把伞。\n\"走。\"他说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 2,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at",
    "spoken_dialogue": "去哪？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念看着他。\"去哪？\"\n\"你跟我来。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 3,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the coffee cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "watercolor painting",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念犹豫了两秒。她解下围裙，挂在吧台后面的挂钩上。围裙上的咖啡渍在灯光下像一幅抽象画。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 4,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian walks out the door",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她跟着顾深走出门。巷子里的青石板被昨晚的雨洗得很干净，反射着早晨的阳光。\n顾深把伞递给她。苏念接过去，没撑开——天没下雨。\n他们沿着巷子走。顾深走在前面，苏念走"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 5,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen walks slowly the coffee cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "这里。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "\"这里。\"顾深停在巷口的一棵梧桐树下。树干上有人刻过字，但已经模糊了。\"我第一次来喝咖啡，走的就是这条路。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 6,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian carries a steaming cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "那天你穿了一件灰色西装。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念看着那棵树。她不记得顾深第一次来的样子。\n\"那天你穿了一件灰色西装。\"顾深说。\"领带是深蓝色的。你端咖啡的时候，围裙上沾了一点奶泡。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 7,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian looks down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念低头看了看自己的围裙——今天没有奶泡。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 8,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen hand pauses mid-motion",
    "spoken_dialogue": "装修中，暂停营业。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他们继续走。顾深带她拐进另一条巷子，走到一家面馆门口。面馆还没开门，卷帘门拉下来，门上贴着一张手写的告示：\"装修中，暂停营业。\"\n\"我们在这里吃过面。\"顾深说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 9,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian struggles to remember",
    "spoken_dialogue": "然后你问我——为什么想收购你的店。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念看着那张告示。她不记得这碗面。\n\"然后你问我——为什么想收购你的店。\"顾深的声音很平，像在复述一段天气预报。\"我说是公司的决定。你问我的决定是什么。我没回答"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 10,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the umbrella",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念的指甲在伞柄上划了一下。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 11,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你现在能回答吗？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你现在能回答吗？\"她问。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 12,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen gazes at",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "顾深看着她。灰色的眼睛在阳光下变成了浅棕色。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 13,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen speaks softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我的决定是——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"我的决定是——\"他说，\"不收购。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 14,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "但公司——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念的呼吸停了一秒。\n\"但公司——\"\n\"我已经辞职了。\"顾深说。他的声音没有起伏，像是在说\"今天天气不错\"。\"昨天递的辞呈。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 15,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你为什么辞职？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念看着他。他的西装还是昨天那件，但领带换了——换成了一条浅灰色的，比之前的细一点。\n\"你为什么辞职？\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 16,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen sits down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "因为我发现——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"因为我发现——\"顾深的目光移开了，看着面馆的卷帘门，\"我坐在这里喝咖啡的时候，比坐在办公室里看收购计划的时候，更像一个人。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 17,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian digs fingernails into palm",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念的指甲陷进掌心。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 18,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen walks slowly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他们继续走。顾深带她走到一个公园——很小的那种，只有几张长椅和一棵大榕树。榕树的气根垂下来，像一道帘子。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 19,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen sees something",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你在这里读过我一次。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "watercolor painting",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你在这里读过我一次。\"顾深说。\"你喝了我放在长椅上的咖啡。你看到了我和前女友分手的画面。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 20,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念看着那张长椅。椅子上有一层薄薄的露水。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 21,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian sees something",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你看到了什么？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你看到了什么？\"她问。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 22,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen drains the cup in one gulp",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你喝完之后，看着我。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你喝完之后，看着我。\"顾深说。\"你的眼睛里有一种表情——不是同情，不是可怜。是——\"他停了一下，找到一个词，\"——理解。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 23,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian trembles visibly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你从来没用那种眼神看过我。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "苏念的手在发抖。\n\"你从来没用那种眼神看过我。\"顾深说。\"所有人都觉得我冷、理性、不会难过。只有你——你喝了我的咖啡之后，看我的眼神变了。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 24,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian digs fingernails into palm",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念的指甲在伞柄上掐出了痕迹。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 25,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你知道我在听什么。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你知道我在听什么。\"苏念说。这不是问句。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 26,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen drains the cup in one gulp",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我不确定。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"我不确定。\"顾深说。\"但我知道——你每次喝完我的咖啡，都会失去一点什么。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 27,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念的呼吸停了。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 28,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian sees something",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你看到了？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你看到了？\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 29,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen drains the cup in one gulp",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你的手。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "back of hand",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "\"你的手。\"顾深说。\"你每次喝完，都会低头看手。你的手背上——有些东西在消失。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 30,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian looks down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念低头看自己的手。现在什么都没有了。光滑得像一张白纸。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 31,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你知道代价是什么。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你知道代价是什么。\"苏念说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 32,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen speaks softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我不确定。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"我不确定。\"顾深说。\"但我知道——你失去的东西越来越多。你忘掉了外婆的声音。忘掉了父母的脸。忘掉了你哥哥。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 33,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian tears roll down cheeks",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你为什么不阻止我？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Sadness",
    "source_text": "苏念的眼眶热了。她没哭。\n\"你为什么不阻止我？\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 34,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian trembles visibly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "因为我阻止不了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "\"因为我阻止不了。\"顾深的声音在发抖——苏念第一次听到他的声音发抖。\"你每次喝我的咖啡，都是你自己的选择。我不能替你选。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 35,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian digs fingernails into palm",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念的指甲陷进掌心，血珠渗出来。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 36,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen picks up",
    "spoken_dialogue": "但我可以——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"但我可以——\"顾深从口袋里拿出一样东西。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 37,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the photo",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "old photo",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "是一张照片。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 38,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen gazes at the coffee cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "这是苏远。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "old photo",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "照片里是一个男孩和一个女孩，站在咖啡店门口。男孩八九岁，女孩五六岁。男孩的手搭在女孩肩膀上。\n和林可给她看的那张一模一样。\n但这张照片——没有模糊。男孩的脸是清"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 39,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the photo",
    "spoken_dialogue": "这张照片——你从哪里来的？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "old photo",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念看着那张脸。她不认识。\n\"这张照片——你从哪里来的？\"\n\"你外婆给我的。\"顾深说。\"三年前，我第一次来这条巷子，不是为了收购。是为了找一个人。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 40,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly the coffee cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "找谁？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念的呼吸停了。\n\"找谁？\"\n\"找苏远。\"顾深说。\"我大学的时候，有一个同学叫苏远。他退学了，没说原因。我一直在找他。后来我找到了这条巷子，找到了念想咖啡店。但"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 41,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他停了。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 42,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "但他已经死了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"但他已经死了。\"苏念说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 43,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen speaks softly the coffee cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你外婆告诉我的。她给了我这张照片。她说——'你是苏远的朋友？那你以后来喝咖啡吧。'",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "old photo",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"对。\"顾深说。\"你外婆告诉我的。她给了我这张照片。她说——'你是苏远的朋友？那你以后来喝咖啡吧。'\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 44,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian tears roll down cheeks",
    "spoken_dialogue": "所以你来喝咖啡——不是为了收购。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Sadness",
    "source_text": "苏念的眼泪掉下来了。她没擦。\n\"所以你来喝咖啡——不是为了收购。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 45,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen trembles visibly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "一开始不是。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "\"一开始不是。\"顾深说。\"后来公司发现了这条巷子的商业价值，让我负责收购。我——\"他的声音在发抖，\"我不知道该怎么办。一边是公司，一边是——\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 46,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian tears roll down cheeks",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Sadness",
    "source_text": "他没说完。\n苏念看着他。他的灰色眼睛里有泪光，但没掉下来。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 47,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你现在知道了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你现在知道了。\"苏念说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 48,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen speaks softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "知道了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"知道了。\"顾深说。\"我辞职了。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 49,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian flips through the photo",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "handwriting",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念把照片接过来。照片的边角已经泛黄了，但男孩的脸是清晰的。\n她把照片翻过来。背面有一行字，外婆的字迹："
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 50,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Yuan",
    "action_visual": "Su Yuan stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "小念，苏远一直在你身边。只是你忘了。",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "*\"小念，苏远一直在你身边。只是你忘了。\"*"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 51,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian looks up",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "handwriting",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念的指尖在字迹上停了三秒。\n然后她抬头。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 52,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "顾深。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"顾深。\"\n\"嗯。\"\n\"谢谢你。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 53,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen turns around",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我们回去吧。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "顾深点了点头。他转身，看着那棵大榕树。气根在风里轻轻晃动。\n\"我们回去吧。\"他说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 54,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian looks down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "old photo",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他们往回走。巷子里的阳光把他们的影子拉得很长，两个影子并排着，在青石板上慢慢移动。\n苏念的手里攥着那张照片。照片的边缘被她的体温捂热了。\n她低头看了一眼。"
  },
  {
